      {
        "id": "permutation-definition-textbook",
        "moduleId": "permutation",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "definition",
        "title": "排列的定义与排列数",
        "markdown": "从 $n$ 个不同元素中任取 $m$（$m \\leqslant n$，$m,n \\in \\mathbf{N}$）个元素，将取得的元素按照一定的顺序排成一列，称为从 $n$ 个不同元素中取出 $m$ 个元素的一个**排列**；所有这样排列的个数称为**排列数**，用符号 $A_n^m$ 表示。\n\n排列的过程强调的是“选取具有规定顺序的元素”。排列数的计算公式为\n\n$$A_n^m = n(n-1)(n-2)\\cdots(n-m+1) = \\frac{n!}{(n-m)!}$$",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-e1f9c42a00f16944b6b1b76c",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000010"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "初等数学",
                "排列组合和二项式定理"
              ],
              "lineStart": 844,
              "lineEnd": 1040,
              "assetRefs": [
                "parts/part-0001/images/849d34738ed5abc381de466a0cc9d9eda7844974d8adc16b4f43de7b5d788bfc.jpg"
              ],
              "excerptSha256": "eea4ea38f2523530eff3ba5f912483bf6e998b619fc9ccae04fd2f5b8a860ac3"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "permutation-product-model",
        "moduleId": "permutation",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "补充：乘积形式从哪里来",
        "markdown": "排列数公式的每个因子对应一次选择。第 1 个位置可从 $n$ 个元素中任选，第 2 个位置只能从剩下的 $n-1$ 个元素中选，如此继续，到第 $m$ 个位置时只剩 $n-m+1$ 个元素可选。按乘法原理把这 $m$ 个选择数相乘就得到 $A_n^m = n(n-1)\\cdots(n-m+1)$；把分子分母同时补上 $(n-m)!$，即可写成阶乘比 $\\frac{n!}{(n-m)!}$。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "permutation-definition-textbook"
          ]
        }
      },
