      {
        "id": "binomial-theorem-textbook",
        "moduleId": "binomial-theorem",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "formula",
        "title": "二项式定理",
        "markdown": "二项式定理又称为牛顿二项式定理，它可将两个数之和的整数次幂展开为相应项之和：\n\n$$(x+y)^n = \\binom{n}{0}x^n y^0 + \\binom{n}{1}x^{n-1}y^1 + \\cdots + \\binom{n}{n}x^0 y^n = \\sum_{m=0}^{n}\\binom{n}{m}x^{n-m}y^m$$\n\n其中 $\\binom{n}{m} = \\frac{n!}{m!\\,(n-m)!}$ 称为**二项式系数**。根据二项式公式和组合计算公式，展开式还可以写成 $\\sum_{m=0}^{n} C_n^m x^{n-m} y^m$。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
